A||||15||Mach10||Very odd... Loss of power...||||5||
Z||000000||Mach10||11-17-2001||04:06 AM||||Uncle! Uncle I say! I give!<P>Can't figure this one out, for the life of me &gt;:\<P>My car is getting progressively weaker. No codes, just doesn't press me into the seat like it does. Even my girlfriend commented... Ok, so maybe it needs a tuneup? Sure, but I just did, 2 months ago. <BR>So here's the WEIRD bit: Whenever I reset the ECM, I get my "balls" back, for a short while. After, say, 500km, it starts falling again. <P>ECM pulls NO codes, except for ONE 34 EGR system. After pulling and inspecting all vac. lines to the EGR system, it went away... I have a new O2 sensor, new plugs, wires, cap and rotor, new fuel filter... What the hell do I replace next?<P>Here's my theories:<BR>Ignition system,<BR>Base timing,<BR>MAP<BR>MAT<BR>TPS<BR>EGR re-work<BR>Injector failiure<P>Anyone have any theories? It's not a loss in a specific part of the powerband... It's across the board. Like someone tied a medium-sized log to my bumper  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_watchout.gif"><BR>||||reg||5
Z||000001||johnt671||11-17-2001||07:56 AM||||Maybe coil and fuel filter.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Mach10||11-17-2001||12:33 PM||||Suppose it's possible... Fuel filter is new... Any other takers? I'll probably end up replacing EVERYTHING eventually... But I'd like to do it in an intelligent fashion  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||10
Z||000003||VeeSixGeeTee||11-17-2001||01:01 PM||||Hmm, maybe your cat is pluged up???  Witch would cause a huge power decrease! <P>------------------<BR>Mikey<BR>85 GT 4sp..Taking a six month nap!<BR>AIM: KilleredGT||||reg||1
Z||000004||Mach10||11-17-2001||02:11 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by VeeSixGeeTee:<BR><B>Hmm, maybe your cat is pluged up???  Witch would cause a huge power decrease! <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Could be, except that was the FIRST thing I had chopped out. Got a cherry-bomb there, now  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Oh, one more piece of info: It starts running richer and richer as time goes on... What the hell!??!<P>||||reg||5
