Z||000008||Ferrari_cdn||11-17-2001||04:56 PM||||Maybe your car is trying to tell you that she's tired of your heavy feet?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ferrari_cdn" TARGET=_blank> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ferrari_cdn.JPG">  </A>  <BR>AIM: CanadianFiero||||reg||10
